  "worked_solution": "The rate of change in the profit of Bob's business per day increases in proportion to $\\frac{1}{t}$ and increases further by $20.$ The differential equation that describes this is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}P}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{k}{t}+20,\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is the (positive) constant of proportionality.",
